{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "668837bdc70df8230e50569dc0a7cbe24e03336ddf459480a993d27209e83272", "ja": "（今日は劇場で、雑誌の取材がある。\n紬もそろそろ来る時間だと思うけど……）", "zh": "（今天要在剧场接受杂志采访。紬差不多也该来了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5358990d75d464bb3f241d62cf14705d4ad8c00d1a68a7a688cd426d0744ce82", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}。\nすみません、お待たせしてしまいました。", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}。\n抱歉，让您久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6aa7ec127a2964ded3eeaea0e8743c2e3f4649b85bbe1a93ffd6b6b211db5c9c", "ja": "私服で来てほしいとのことだったので、\n準備をしていたのですが。少々手間取ってしまって。", "zh": "因为听说希望我穿便服过来，所以我一直在准备。不过准备起来稍微费了点时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1ef4e10df8480ea5bb4d11922abbd5ea3a3f40fce74d82c9e06bacb1443883e9", "ja": "え？　ああ、おはよう。\n大丈夫。全然待ってないよ、時間通りだ。", "zh": "诶？啊，早上好。\n没关系，我完全没等，来得很准时。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e5f69cd98b90e748c2268e7a597f090a73f6813f7a85406de3fe1b75df9cfb5d", "ja": "そうですか。よかった……。\n……あの、ひとつ聞いてもよろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "这样啊。太好了……\n\n……那个，可以问您一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fdd73c15e4c477922579dbed96cb9bd183a982e8b9a6383735d240644ba063a6", "ja": "私が挨拶をした時、少しだけ間がありましたよね。\nまさか、何かおかしなところでも！？", "zh": "我打招呼的时候，您停顿了一下呢。\n该不会，是哪里有什么奇怪的地方吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7615b1e44a64d89db27580432a6509d659910e81d130aec8b9df46a3b4443d4b", "ja": "いや、おかしなところはないよ。髪型とか服装とか、\nいつもと雰囲気が違ったから、一瞬……。", "zh": "不，没有什么奇怪的地方。只是发型、服装之类的和往常的感觉不太一样，所以一瞬间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0e99fbd584192b6a7fc19f89e84d1764ae97810bc8f9ee26d49838ff214081d3", "ja": "……なるほど、よくわかりました。\nこれ以上の言い訳は、不要です。", "zh": "……原来如此，我很清楚了。\n用不着再找借口了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a21993efe47aef18f4d83f2d8b23be1d2c1760dc5f46ef58d12970c9feae75ee", "ja": "見慣れたあなたでも、容姿が変わったことで、\n私が誰なのか、判別がつかなかったというのですね。", "zh": "即便是早已熟悉的您，也因为我改变了外貌，而无法辨认出我是谁，是吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d7b780c6bfcf7a9a7d69c0ca42093ed949b754c779f1b5859b2a53fcd3c01bd5", "ja": "常々、鈍感な方だと感じていましたが……\nこれほどまでに薄情だとは、思ってもみませんでした。", "zh": "我一直觉得您是个迟钝的人……\n却没想到您竟然会薄情到这种地步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1010_p", "source_sha256": "28eac14bc555f83a5174ea067bee8e7077575ca6be8bb66a771b6f3f0f4b9203", "ja": "誤解だ、紬！　まあ、見間違えたのは確かだけど……。\nそれは紬が綺麗だったから、一瞬言葉に詰まったんだ。", "zh": "是误会，紬！确实是我认错了……但那是因为紬太好看了，我一时间说不出话来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bfb78fc538d42dc26db45801d4044c3aa8840be54bcb645d0807273fafdd1bd6", "ja": "え？　……えっ？　き、れいに……ええっ！？\nな、なな、なに言うとるん！？", "zh": "诶？……诶？漂、漂亮地……诶诶！？  \n你、你你、你在说什么啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "00ef8ea300e71f5b237764c844268df89cbc2f91550fe9e8217118adb1dc4a0c", "ja": "き、綺麗だなんて……\nがんこ恥ずかしい台詞を、すらすらと……！", "zh": "居、居然说漂亮什么的……  \n这么害羞的话，居然还能这么顺溜地说出来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1013_p", "source_sha256": "90c685bb5c66e437f11c46b3c35322f97b12881921abd11a16bcd73da3a92030", "ja": "え？　なんか、ごめんな。\nただ、本当にそう思ったから伝えただけで……。", "zh": "诶？怎么说呢，抱歉啊。\n只是因为我真的这么想，所以才告诉你的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3653aef35584ceb05dd48fd0e60b5a214c6cea57ba5f92f9971f79087030ee7b", "ja": "で……ですから、そういうところです！\n大人でしたら、恥じらいを持ってください！", "zh": "所……所以说，就是这种地方！\n作为大人，请保持一点羞耻心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1015_p", "source_sha256": "61bfa9dfcdaa3c39d27c8926af38d864f560b54c6dcff3c51f7bb71125ac12b4", "ja": "はい。以後、気をつけます……。", "zh": "好的，我以后会注意的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c4720e0f2b565e05c6247d0f5508ec9b6027a071cae6b996e52c929535c47f68", "ja": "私も少々勘違いをしてましたし……。\nその……褒めてくださったのは、本当に嬉しいです。", "zh": "我也稍微有些误会了……\n那个……您夸奖我，真的让我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4503f8b91beb0cccdbf5777c2d8d07ecbac258efb8db0c753f64055bb804c8c6", "ja": "ああ。でもよく似合……おっと、恥じらいだったな。\nとにかく、この後の取材よろしくな。", "zh": "啊。不过真的很适合……哎呀，你会害羞来着。总之，接下来的采访就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8a1c8a45fd2eaa3a27ff926b21821d081e841ccf107ad17818d9b0141e0a3df7", "ja": "もちろんです。誠心誠意、私自身の言葉で、\nしっかりとお答えできるよう努めます。ただ……。", "zh": "那是当然。我会诚心诚意，努力用我自己的语言，\n好好回答每一个问题的。只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0274_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7cb7e29541db49aedf8abde1bd091052f3f4bc56c68c4151580b8e141412159e", "ja": "先に、メイクを直してきてもよろしいでしょうか？\n……あなたのせいで、汗をかいてしまったようなので。", "zh": "我可以先去补一下妆吗？\n……好像都怪你，让我出汗了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
